### RTP Payload Format for V-DMC (`draft-ietf-avtcore-rtp-vdmc`)
- **Presentation:** [V-DMC Slides](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-avtcore-v-dmc-slides-00)
- **Presenter:** Hyunseok Yang
