## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-avtcore-hevc-webrtc`**: Submit Publication Request to the IESG.
2. **`draft-ietf-avtcore-rtp-vdmc`**: Submit Publication Request to the IESG without a second WGLC.
3. **Opus Multistream SDP Signaling**: Working group chairs will launch a second Call for Adoption on the revised draft (`opus/48000/X` syntax).
4. **Absolute Capture Time**: Chairs will send a query to the mailing list to determine whether to park `draft-ietf-avtcore-abs-capture-time` or seek a new editor.

